                                               nxdownload, nxget, nxminfo,
                                               nxupload, nxwsget, nddload
  database drivers (src/db/dbdrv)      GPL
  network device drivers               LGPL or GPL as stated in each driver's
    (src/server/drivers)               files; tplink, qtech and eltex: MIT
  notification channel drivers         LGPL, except nxagent, shell, smtp,
    (src/server/ncdrivers)             textfile and xmpp: GPL
  performance data storage drivers     LGPL    clickhouse, influxdb
    (src/server/pdsdrv)


